read-only sender must be refused; got ToolResult { success: true, output: ToolOutput { text: "accepted for in-process delivery to peer agent \"recipient\" (task_id=41675690-3c54-4768-9bbd-746a47efdb26)", data: None, attachments: [] }, error: None }
