master @ 1c1cd118ac536a1dd1bc79b9cce69cbdc04e4f29 (`git describe`: v0.8.7-28-g1c1cd118a). The same result was obtained earlier at 5d4b18d335780af8bf15979b2f45e541f91c5eb9 (the "bump version to v0.8.7" commit); `send_message_to_peer.rs` is identical in both.

